                "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will not rot; he seeketh unto him a cunning workman to prepare a graven image,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall not be moved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have ye not known? have ye not heard? hath it not been told you from the beginning? have ye not understood from the foundations of the earth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that sitteth upon the circle of the earth, and the inhabitants thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as grasshoppers; that stretcheth out the heavens as a curtain, and spreadeth them out as a tent to dwell in:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
