          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That bringeth the princes to nothing; he maketh the judges of the earth as vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, they shall not be planted; yea, they shall not be sown: yea, their stock shall not take root in the earth: and he shall also blow upon them, and they shall wither, and the whirlwind shall take them away as stubble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To whom then will ye liken me, or shall I be equal? saith the Holy One.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lift up your eyes on high, and behold who hath created these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that bringeth out their host by number: he calleth them all by names by the greatness of his might, for that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.40.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong in power; not one faileth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
